# 13. Architecture requirements

The plugin must fit the existing Remmi architecture:

```text
Remmi/
├── core/
├── ui/
└── plugins/
```

The plugin is an independent Remmi workspace/domain.

Plugin-specific:

* business logic
* models
* local state
* persistence
* repositories, only if genuinely necessary
* UI
* external-service integration

should remain owned by the plugin where appropriate.

Core should contain only genuinely shared/fundamental Remmi infrastructure.

Do not move plugin business logic into Core merely for convenience.

Do not create generic shared abstractions prematurely.

