# 17. Plugin isolation

The plugin must fail gracefully.

A plugin failure must not crash:

* Home
* Apps
* Global Search
* other plugins
* the Remmi shell

Do not allow plugin-specific failures to become application-wide failures
unless the failure is genuinely in shared Core infrastructure.

